  "description": "Seong Seowol, the eldest daughter of the Seong family, spends her days engrossed in all kinds of erotic illustrated books, fantasizing about experiencing carnal pleasure for herself. However, due to her father’s fierce opposition, she postpones marriage even after passing what is considered a suitable age to wed. Eventually, she marries Young Master Gyeongho, a man from the village known for his intimidating reputation. But to Seowol’s disappointment, despite eagerly anticipating their wedding night, Gyeongho remains completely guarded, and the two fail to consummate their marriage…    \n\n“There’s no way my husband is impotent…!” \n\nConvinced that the problem stems from her husband’s lack of knowledge, Seowol decides to take matters into her own hands and teach him personally. Every month, on the night of the fifteenth, beneath the full moon, the couple’s sensual lessons in carnal pleasure begin.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/moonlit_kiss)",
